<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Arnold" data-copy-zh="Arnold">Arnold</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Use Arnold’s mansion conversations and Household Risk to support the connected corporate route." data-copy-zh="在宅邸与Arnold交谈，通过家庭风险交心推进相连的企业路线。">Use Arnold’s mansion conversations and Household Risk to support the connected corporate route.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Scenes_That_Also_Reward_Arnold"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Household_Risk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Household_Risk_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Household_Risk_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_Arnold"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Arnold — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/arnold.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Arnold — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/arnold.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Arnold — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Arnold is a mansion contact in the present-era story and the connected Miki/Evangeline corporate route. His practical personal milestone is Household Risk.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Mansion_Access"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Use the Downtown map’s Mansion from Story52 onward; ordinary map entry is18:00–23:00, then enter the foyer for0min. Arnold’s ordinary foyer portrait is all day while he is currently available, but that schedule does not override the entrance hours. For his20:00–24:00 conversation, arrive before23:00 if coming from outside.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Complete Meeting Arnold at the foyer. Conversation is available from Stranger 0 and can raise Known 25 for his later heart-to-heart.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Meeting Arnold</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Mansion Foyer (Downtown)</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Household Risk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Mansion Foyer (Downtown); Known (25); after Hostile Mentorship; 20:00–23:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">75 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>After Hostile Mentorship, start Household Risk in the foyer 20:00–24:00:Known 25,75 min, once. No additional money, Energy or Calm cost is listed.</p><p>This conversation is a prerequisite in the later corporate chain. Continue Miki’s and Evangeline’s scenes and investment milestones through their own guides; the conversation does not buy companies or replace their relationship requirements.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Arnold.27s_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Arnold's_Actions"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Mansion Foyer (Downtown); during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 90/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk takes 15 min and gives 1 base affection, up to 90/day. His current menu has no separate romance date or personal skill lesson.</p><p>Favorite stats are Intelligence, Charm. Learning Master Engineer improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If Household Risk is missing, complete Miki’s mentorship scene first, then return in the evening.</li><li>If the portrait is absent at the correct time, follow the currently available main-story or mansion objective; later story progress can override his schedule.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-miki.html">Miki’s corporate route</a></li><li><a href="character-evangeline.html">Evangeline</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">Investment milestones</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progression</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Scenes_That_Also_Reward_Arnold"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Household_Risk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Household_Risk_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Household_Risk_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_Arnold"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Arnold 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/arnold.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Arnold 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/arnold.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Arnold 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Arnold是现代宅邸主线及Miki、Evangeline企业路线的联系人。他的主要个人进展是家庭风险。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Mansion_Access"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>主线进度到52起，可从市中心地图进入宅邸，地图入口通常开放18:00–23:00，再以0分钟进入门厅。Arnold当前可用时的门厅头像为全天，但不能绕过入口时段。要进行20:00–24:00的交心，从外面前往时请在23:00前进入。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先在门厅完成与Arnold会面。陌生人0即可交谈，逐步提升到后续交心所需的已知25。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Arnold会面</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">豪宅门厅（市中心）</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">家庭风险</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">豪宅门厅（市中心）；已知（25好感）；完成：敌意式指导；20:00–23:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">75分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>完成敌意式指导后，可在门厅20:00–24:00进行家庭风险：已知25、75分钟，仅一次，没有额外金钱、精力或镇定消耗。</p><p>这次交心是后续企业事件的前置。Miki、Evangeline各自的事件与投资里程碑见对应指南；这次交心不会替你购买公司，也不能替代她们的关系要求。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Arnold.27s_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Arnold's_Actions"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">豪宅门厅（市中心）；头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天90次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈消耗15分钟、增加1基础好感，每天最多90次。目前没有独立恋爱约会或个人技能课程。</p><p>偏好的属性为智力、魅力。学会工程大师可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>家庭风险不出现时，先完成Miki的指导事件，再于晚间返回。</li><li>正确时间仍无头像时，继续当前可进行的主线或宅邸目标；后续剧情可能优先于日常行程。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="character-miki.html">Miki的企业路线</a></li><li><a href="character-evangeline.html">Evangeline</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">投资里程碑</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线进度</a></li></ul></section>
